#\#CIF_1.1

# A synthetic acetonitrile (CH3CN) structure block exercising the
# T3 structure and chemistry data names: the chemical single items,
# the atom_type loop, the chemical_conn_atom and chemical_conn_bond
# loops, the geom special-list loops (angle, bond, contact, hbond,
# torsion), the atom_sites solution codes and transform family, and
# the valence parameter and reference loops.

